<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Student Activity Tracker</title>

<style>
body{
font-family:Arial;
background:lightskyblue;
text-align:center;
}

.card{
background:#ffe0b2;
width:320px;
margin:20px auto;
padding:20px;
border-radius:10px;
box-shadow:0 4px 8px gray;
}

button{
background:#4CAF50;
color:white;
border:none;
padding:8px 15px;
border-radius:5px;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:10px;
}

button:hover{
background:#2e7d32;
}

.pending{
color:red;
font-weight:bold;
}

.completed{
color:green;
font-weight:bold;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>Student Activity Tracker</h1>

<div class="card">
<h3>1. Event Handling in JavaScript</h3>
<p>Handle user events using JavaScript.</p>
<span id="s1" class="pending">Status: Pending</span><br>
<button onclick="completeActivity('s1',this)">Mark Completed</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>2. Mini Web Project</h3>
<p>Create a small web application.</p>
<span id="s2" class="pending">Status: Pending</span><br>
<button onclick="completeActivity('s2',this)">Mark Completed</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>3. Form Creation</h3>
<p>Design and implement HTML forms.</p>
<span id="s3" class="pending">Status: Pending</span><br>
<button onclick="completeActivity('s3',this)">Mark Completed</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>4. Web Page Layout</h3>
<p>Create page structure using CSS.</p>
<span id="s4" class="pending">Status: Pending</span><br>
<button onclick="completeActivity('s4',this)">Mark Completed</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>5. Final Review</h3>
<p>Check and test the entire project.</p>
<span id="s5" class="pending">Status: Pending</span><br>
<button onclick="completeActivity('s5',this)">Mark Completed</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>6. UI Design Practice</h3>
<p>Improve user interface design.</p>
<span id="s6" class="pending">Status: Pending</span><br>
<button onclick="completeActivity('s6',this)">Mark Completed</button>
</div>

<h2 id="progress">0 out of 6 activities completed (0%)</h2>

<script>
let count = 0;
let total = 6;

function completeActivity(id,btn){

let status = document.getElementById(id);

if(status.innerHTML === "Status: Pending"){

status.innerHTML = "Status: Completed";
status.style.color = "green";

btn.disabled = true;

count++;

let percent = Math.round((count/total)*100);

document.getElementById("progress").innerHTML =
count + " out of " + total + " activities completed (" + percent + "%)";

}

}
</script>

</body>
</html>
